mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;background:rgb(255,255,255);">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>小班化分组教学，采用理论讲解，实验操作，并结合研讨教学。</p>
<p>Small-group teaching employs a combination of theoretical instruction, hands-on experiments, and seminar-style discussions.</p></font></span><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height:22.4500pt;">
                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;background:rgb(217,217,217);">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋">4.教学内容及进度安排</font></span></b><b
                                style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-ascii-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-hansi-font-family:'Times New Roman';
mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="Times New Roman">/Course Content & Schedule</font></span></b><b
                                style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋">（</font></span><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Courier New';font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋">按照教学周编排，应包含每节课教学内容及教学目标，如有作业及考核要求，请一并列明）</font></span><b
                                style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height:176.7000pt;">
                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">临床医学六年制（MBBS）计划为第7学期上课，包括绪论和考试共计16周。根据具体情况，挑选实验内容选择性开课。</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>1、</strong><strong>教学单元名称：绪论</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>授课时间</strong>：6-10节（6-10节理论讲解）</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>教学内容</strong>：</span></p>
<ul>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">功能学科实验教学安排、教学内容、教学要求；</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">2）功能学科实验室相关要求和管理流程；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">3）器材耗材管理、仪器设备使用、动物伦理规范；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">4）超星平台使用、实验报告提交以及其他事项；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">5）功能学科实验基本技能、逻辑思维、辩证能力等。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>教学目的</strong>：</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1）了解功能学科教学实验的性质、地位和任务及其教学目的；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">2）明确学生进入实验室必须遵守的各项规则；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">3）告知日常考核及期末考试内容，介绍实验报告的书写格式和要求；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">4）了解和掌握常用实验动物的基本知识；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">5）了解实验室常用仪器、设备及手术器械。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Title of Lession 1: Introduction</strong><strong> </strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Class period：6-10</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Purpose and requests:</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1.introduction of experiments of medical functional science</span></p>
<ol start="2">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Learn how to recognize the health animal and identify the sex, and know about common animals use in experiments including toads and frogs, mice, rats, guinea pigs and rabbits.</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">3.Recognize the operating scalpel, surgical scissors, surgical forceps, needles used to destroy frog’s spinal cord and glass dissecting needles and learn the usage methods.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">4.Introduce the &nbsp;basic Techniques of Operation in Animal Experiments</span></p>
<ol start="5">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Compositions and Uses of Several Kinds of Physiological Saline</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">The usage of Biological signal processing system, includes all kinds of transducer, amplifier, computer and software.</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>2、</strong><strong>教学单元名称：手术操作训练（一）</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>授课时间</strong>：6-9节（6节理论讲解，7-9节实验操作配合研讨）</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>教学内容：</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1）家兔的捉拿、称重；麻醉、固定；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">2）皮肤切开、组织分离；气管插管；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">3）分离迷走、降压神经；颈动脉插管；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">4）使用生物信号采集系统记录血压、心电；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">5）教学软件和仪器的使用。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>教学目的</strong>：</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1）掌握家兔的捉拿、称重；麻醉、固定；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">2）掌握皮肤切开、组织分离；气管插管；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">3）掌握分离迷走、降压神经；颈动脉插管；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">4）在完成上述操作的基础上记录一段正常的血压、心电；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">5）掌握教学软件和仪器的使用。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Title of Lession 2. Basic Techniques of Operation in Animal Experiments（I）</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Class period：6-10</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Purpose and requests:</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Be familiar with the skills and operations on rabbits and mice.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Contents:</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Anaesthesia and fixation of the rabbit</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Subcutaneous injection on rabbit</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Make incision on the neck skin and tissue</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Endotracheal intubation</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Separate vagus nerves and aortic nerve</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Carotid arteries intubation</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Separate femoral artery</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Diaphragm exposure</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Ureter intubation</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Find the appendix</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">intraperitoneal injection 、 subcutaneous injection on the mouse</span></li>
</ol>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>3、</strong><strong>教学单元名称：手术操作训练（二）</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>授课时间</strong>：6-9节（6节理论讲解，7-9节实验操作配合研讨）</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>教学内容：</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1）家兔的捉拿、称重； 麻醉、固定；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">2）家兔皮肤切开、组织分离；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">3）家兔气管插管；颈动脉插管；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">4）家兔的暴露膈肌和暴露输尿管；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">5）生物信号采集系统记录血压、心电，测量和分析；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">6）教学软件和仪器的使用；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">7）小鼠的基本实验操作，包括捉拿固定，腹腔注射，脱臼处死。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>教学</strong><strong>目的</strong>：</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1）掌握家兔的捉拿、称重；麻醉、固定；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">2）掌握皮肤切开、组织分离；气管插管；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">3）掌握分离迷走、降压神经；颈动脉插管；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">4）在完成上述操作的基础上记录一段正常的血压、心电；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">5）掌握家兔的暴露膈肌和暴露输尿管；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">6）掌握小鼠的基本实验操作，包括捉拿固定，腹腔注射，脱臼处死；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">7）掌握教学软件和仪器的使用。</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Title of Lession 3. Basic Techniques of Operation in Animal Experiments(II)</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Class period：6-10</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Purpose and requests:</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Be familiar with the skills and operations on rabbits and mice.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Contents:</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Anaesthesia and fixation of the rabbit</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Subcutaneous injection on rabbit</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Make incision on the neck skin and tissue</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Endotracheal intubation</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Separate vagus nerves and aortic nerve</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Carotid arteries intubation</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Separate femoral artery</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Diaphragm exposure</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Ureter intubation</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Find the appendix</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">intraperitoneal injection 、 subcutaneous injection on the mouse</span></li>
</ol>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>4、</strong><strong>教学单元名称：神经干动作电位电生理实验</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>授课时间：</strong>6-9节（6节理论讲解，7-9节实验操作配合研讨）</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>教学内容：</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1）神经干复合动作电位的细胞外记录方法；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">2）动作电位的传导速度、相对不应期和绝对不应期；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">3）测绘刺激时间-强度曲线；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">4）神经干动作电位生理特性及药物对其特性。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>教学</strong><strong>目的</strong>：</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1）掌握神经干复合动作电位的细胞外记录方法；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">2）掌握动作电位的传导速度、相对不应期和绝对不应期;</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">3）学会测绘刺激时间-强度曲线；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">4）理解神经干动作电位生理特性及药物对其特性的影响。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Title of Lession 4.The electrophysiological experiments of compound action potentials on toad sciatic nerve stem</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Class period：6-10</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Purpose and requests</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Learn the method of recording the action potential of neuronal stem.</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Measure the velocity of conduction of the action potential</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Observe the relative refractory period and absolute refractory period of the nerve tissue.</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Observe the effect of drugs to the nerve stem action potential</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Contents:</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Part I：Preparation of the sciatic nerve-gastrocnemius muscle sample</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Destroying the toad’s brain and spinal cord</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Preparation for the lower limb sample</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Preparation for the sciatic nerve-gastrocnemius muscle sample</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Part II. Generation of the Action Potential of Nerve Stem</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Setting up the equipment</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Observation and measurement</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Part III: Conduction Velocity of the Action Potential in the Sciatic Nerve</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Preparation for sciatic nerve sample of toad</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Setting up the equipment</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Starting the experimental item</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">The conduction velocity is calculated</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Part IV. Refractory Period of the Action Potential in the Sciatic Nerve</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Prepare the sciatic nerve sample and set up the equipment as described before.</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Measurement of refractory period on toad sciatic nerve</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>5、</strong><strong>教学单元名称：有机磷中毒机制、症状及药物治疗</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>授课时间：</strong>6-9节（6节理论讲解，7-9节实验操作配合研讨）</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>目的要求：</strong>观察阿托品和碘解磷定对敌百虫中毒的解救作用，并从血液中的胆碱酯酶（CHE）活性改变来进一步观察药物的作用机制。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Title of Lession 4.The electrophysiological experiments of compound action potentials on toad sciatic nerve stem</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Class period：6-10</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Purpose and requests</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Learn the method of recording the action potential of neuronal stem.</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Measure the velocity of conduction of the action potential</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Observe the relative refractory period and absolute refractory period of the nerve tissue.</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Observe the effect of drugs to the nerve stem action potential</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Contents:</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Part I：Preparation of the sciatic nerve-gastrocnemius muscle sample</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Destroying the toad’s brain and spinal cord</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Preparation for the lower limb sample</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Preparation for the sciatic nerve-gastrocnemius muscle sample</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Part II. Generation of the Action Potential of Nerve Stem</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Setting up the equipment</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Observation and measurement</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Part III: Conduction Velocity of the Action Potential in the Sciatic Nerve</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Preparation for sciatic nerve sample of toad</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Setting up the equipment</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Starting the experimental item</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">The conduction velocity is calculated</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Part IV. Refractory Period of the Action Potential in the Sciatic Nerve</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Prepare the sciatic nerve sample and set up the equipment as described before.</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Measurement of refractory period on toad sciatic nerve</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>6、</strong><strong>教学单元名称：心血管活动调节及药物的影响</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>授课时间：</strong>6-9节（6节理论讲解，7-9节实验操作配合研讨）</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>教学内容：</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1）家兔动脉插管术和血压描记方法；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">2）观察夹闭颈总动脉、刺激颈迷走神经、降压神经对家兔血压和心率的影响；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">3）观察静脉注射各种药物（如生理盐水、阿托品、肾上腺素、去甲肾上腺素、异丙肾上腺素、酚妥拉明、普萘洛尔）对家兔血压和心率的影响。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>教学</strong><strong>目的：</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1）掌握家兔动脉插管术和血压描记方法；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">2）理解并会分析夹闭颈总动脉、刺激颈迷走神经、降压神经对家兔血压和心率的影响；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">3）理解并会分析静脉注射各种药物（如生理盐水、阿托品、肾上腺素、去甲肾上腺素、异丙肾上腺素、酚妥拉明、普萘洛尔）对家兔血压和心率的影响。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Title of Lession 6. Effect of chemical substances on the activity of the isolated toad heart </strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Class period：6-10</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Purpose and requests</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Investigate the effects of ions (sodium, potassium and calcium) and drugs (acetylcholine and adrenaline) which can stimulate or depress the myocardium on the activity of the toad heart in vitro.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Contents:</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Preparation of the isolated heart and record normal myocardial contraction</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Observation items</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">(1)Record the normal curve of the relaxation and constriction of the isolated heart.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">(2)After the Ringer’s solution in cannula is all replaced by 0.65% NaCl, observe the change of the heartbeat.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">(3) 3% CaCl2</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">(4) 1% KCl</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">(5) 1:10000 adrenalin</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">(6) 1:10000 acetylcholine</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>7、</strong><strong>教学单元名称：药物对哇巴因诱发豚鼠心律失常的保护作用</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>授课时间</strong>：6-9节（6节理论讲解，7-9节实验操作配合研讨）</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>教学内容</strong>：</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1）动物体表心电图的描记方法；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">2）哇巴因诱发豚鼠心律失常的方法；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">3）观察利多卡因对此种心律失常的保护作用。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>教学</strong><strong>目的</strong>：</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1）掌握动物体表心电图的描记方法；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">2）掌握哇巴因诱发豚鼠心律失常的方法；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">3）掌握利多卡因对此种心律失常保护作用的观察方法。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Title of Lession 7. The antagonistic effect of lidocaine on arrhythmia model induced by ouabain in guinea pig </strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Class period：6-10 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Purpose and requests</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">To study how to set up the arrhythmia model induced by ouabain in guinea pig and understand the mechanism of this arrhythmia model.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">To evaluate the therapeutic effect of lidocaine on ouabain-induced arrhythmia.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Contents：</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Preparations.</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Venous cannulation.</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Electrocardiogram recording.</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Ouabain-induced arrhythmia.</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Antagonistic effect of lidocaine.</span></li>
</ol>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>8、</strong><strong>教学单元名称：家兔高钾血症</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>授课时间：</strong>6-9节（6节理论讲解，7-9节实验操作配合研讨）</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>教学内容：</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1）家兔高钾血症模型的复制方法；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">2）观察家兔高钾血症时心电图的变化；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">3）高钾血症的抢救；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">4）高血钾对心脏电生理的影响。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>教学</strong><strong>目的：</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1）掌握家兔高钾血症模型的复制方法；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">2）掌握家兔高钾血症时心电图变化的观察方法；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">3）掌握高钾血症的抢救措施和方法；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">4）掌握实验结果的观察和分析方法，理解高血钾对心脏电生理的影响。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Title of Lession 8. Teaching Unit Title: Hyperkalemia in Rabbits</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Class Time: Periods 6-9 (6 periods for theoretical instruction, periods 7-9 for laboratory practice with discussion)</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Teaching Content:</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1) Methods for inducing hyperkalemia in rabbits;</span><br><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">2) Observation of electrocardiogram changes during rabbit hyperkalemia;</span><br><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">3) Emergency management of hyperkalemia;</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">4) Effects of hyperkalemia on cardiac electrophysiology.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Learning Objectives:</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1) Master the method for inducing hyperkalemia in rabbits;</span><br><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">2) Master the method for observing ECG changes during rabbit hyperkalemia;</span><br><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">3) Master resuscitation measures and methods for hyperkalemia;</span><br><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">4) Master methods for observing and analyzing experimental results, and understand the effects of hyperkalemia on cardiac electrophysiology.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>9、</strong><strong>教学单元名称：呼吸调节及药物影响</strong><strong> </strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>授课时间：</strong>6-9节（6节理论讲解，7-9节实验操作配合研讨）</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>教学内容：</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1）哺乳动物的气管插管术和记录呼吸运动；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">2）吸入气中PO2降低、PCO2升高、血液中pH值降低等化学性刺激；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">3）支气管和细支气管的机械性牵张刺激及药物；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">4）其他各种刺激对家兔呼吸运动的影响。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>教学</strong><strong>目的：</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1）掌握哺乳动物的气管插管术；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">2）掌握记录呼吸运动的方法；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">3）掌握吸入气中PO2降低、PCO2升高、血液中pH值降低等化学性刺激；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">4）掌握支气管和细支气管的机械性牵张刺激；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">5）理解药物和其他各种刺激对家兔呼吸运动的影响的方法、观察和分析。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Title of Lession &nbsp;9. Respiration experiment of rabbit</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Class period：6-10</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Purpose and requests</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">To observe the effects of some factors (including the stimulation to bronchus, PO2 or PCO2 of the air, the pH value of the blood, drugs, and etc) on respiratory movement and the phrenic nerve discharge.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Contents:</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Anaesthesia</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Operation</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Observation items</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">(1) Record a normal phrenic nerve discharge as control</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">(2) Effect of N2</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">(3) Effect of high CO2</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">(4) Effect of anatomical dead space enlargement</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">(5)Pulmonary stretch reflex</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">(6) Effect of cutting off vagus nerve</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">(7) Effect of the drugs:</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Physiological saline (0.9% NaCl): &nbsp;1ml/kg</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">lactic acid: 3%, 1-2ml/kg</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">morphine: 1%，0.5ml/kg</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">nikethamide: 10%, 1ml/kg(slowly)</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>9、</strong><strong>教学单元名称：缺氧</strong><strong> </strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>授课时间</strong>：6-9节（6节理论讲解，7-9节实验操作配合研讨）</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>教学内容：</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1）小鼠身上复制乏氧性、血液性和组织中毒性等类型的缺氧；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">2）小鼠在缺氧时呼吸深度、皮肤黏膜、血液颜色和活动情况的改变；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">3）各类型缺氧的发病原因和机制；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">4）药物对动物缺氧耐受性的影响。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>教学</strong><strong>目的：</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1）掌握乏氧性、血液性和组织中毒性等类型的缺氧基本理论和知识；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">2）掌握小鼠身上复制乏氧性、血液性和组织中毒性等类型的缺氧的方法；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">3）理解小鼠在缺氧时呼吸深度、皮肤黏膜、血液颜色和活动情况的改变；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">4）了解各类型缺氧的发病原因和机制；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">5）了解药物对动物缺氧耐受性的影响。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Title of Lession 9. Hypoxia</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Class period：6-10</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Lesson Purpose and requests</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">To duplicate the animal models of hypotonic, hemic and histogenous hypoxia. To observe the changes in mice breath, color of skin, mucous membrane, blood and organs in different degrees and hypoxia.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Contents</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Part I：hypotonic hypoxia(low PO2)</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Part II：the effect of age to hypoxia</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Part IV：sodium nitrite induced hypoxia</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Part V：potassium cyanide induced hypoxia</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>11、</strong><strong>教学单元名称：家兔实验性弥散性血管内凝血（DIC）</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>授课时间</strong>：6-9节（6节理论讲解，7-9节实验操作配合研讨）</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>教学内容：</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1）静脉注射兔脑浸液，复制家兔实验性DIC。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">2）通过实验和几项血液学指标的测定及结果分析；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">3）实验室诊断DIC的常用方法；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">4）联系理论知识加深理解DIC的病因及发病机制。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>目的要求</strong>：</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1）掌握静脉注射兔脑浸液方法，复制家兔实验性DIC的方法；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">2）理解实验和几项血液学指标的测定及结果分析的方法和意义；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">3）了解实验室诊断DIC的常用方法；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">4）了解联系理论知识；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">5）了解DIC的病因及发病机制。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Title of Lession &nbsp;11. Disseminated intravascular coagulation (DIC) </strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Class period：6-10</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Purpose and requests</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">(1) To learn the duplicating methods the animal model of DIC.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">(2) To observe the changes of blood coagulabilty and analyze the reason and pathophysiologic significance of these changes, understand the etiology and pathogenesis of DIC.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">(3) To understand the diagnostic criteria of DIC and related laboratory diagnosis.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Contents：</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Weight, anesthetize and fix of the rabbit</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Operation at cervical part</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Collection of normal blood for determination</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Duplicate the animal model of DIC</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Collection of DIC blood</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Centrifugate and get the plasma</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">determination of blood coagulation function</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>The plasma is used for determining prothrombin time(PT), Kaolin partial thromboplastin time(KPTT), plasma pritamin paracoagulation(3P) &nbsp;and concentration of the fibrinogen.&nbsp;</strong></span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>12、</strong><strong>教学单元名称：消化道平滑肌生理特性及药物对离体肠的作用</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>授课时间</strong>：6-9节（6节理论讲解，7-9节实验操作配合研讨）</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>教学内容</strong>：</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1）离体豚鼠回肠平滑肌的一般生理特性;</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">2）药物对哺乳动物消化道平滑肌的作用及其机制。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>教学</strong><strong>目的</strong>：</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1）掌握观察离体豚鼠回肠平滑肌的一般生理特性；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">2）理解不同药物对哺乳动物消化道平滑肌的作用；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">3）理解药物对哺乳动物消化道平滑肌的作用机制。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Title of Lession 12. Effects of autonomic drugs on the isolated ileum of guinea pig &nbsp;</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Class period：6-10</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Purpose and requests</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Observe e and analyze the effects of autonomic drugs on the isolated intestinal smooth muscle in vitro.</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Learn the method to establish the model of isolated intestinal smooth muscle.</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Contents：</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Preparation of isolated ileum</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Preparation of experimental equipment and isolated ileum model</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Administration and observation</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Keep the isolated ileum in the thermostatic organ bath, and record the contraction curve of the isolated ileum as normal control with the physiological recorder system. Then begin the following treatments and record the contraction curve of the isolated ileum continuously:</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">(1) Replace the 37℃&nbsp;Tyrode's solution with cold one.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">(2) Add “A” 0.2ml. When reaction curve get to maximum, wash out for 2 times.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">(3) Add “B”0.3ml.Then same treat to step (2)</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">(4) Add“A”0.2ml. When reaction curve get to maximum, add 1:1000 atropine 0.2ml. When the curve keep stable, add”A”0.2ml, when the curve stable again, add”B”0.3ml. When reaction get obvious, wash out for 2 times.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">(5) Add“B”0.3ml.When reaction curve get to maximum, add 1:10000 diphenhydramine 0.3ml. When the curve keep stable, add“B”0.3ml, when the curve stable again, add“A”0.2ml. When reaction get obvious, wash out for 2 times.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">(6) Add1:100BaCl2 0.2ml. When reaction curve get to maximum, add 1:1000 atropine 0.2ml. When reaction get obvious, add1:10000 diphenhydramine 0.3ml.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">(7) infer what are “A” and “B”</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>13、</strong><strong>教学单元名称：神经、体液和药物等因素对尿生成的影响</strong><strong> </strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>授课时间</strong>：6-9节（6节理论讲解，7-9节实验操作配合研讨）</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>教学内容：</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1）输尿管插管术；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">2）尿量的测量和记录方法；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">3）神经、体液及药物等因素对尿液生成的影响。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>教学</strong><strong>目的</strong>：</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1）掌握输尿管插管术；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">2）掌握尿量的测量和记录方法；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">3）理解神经、体液及药物等各种因素对尿液生成的影响。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Title of Lession 13. Factors influencing urine formation</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Class period：6-10</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Purpose and requests</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">To observe some factors influencing urine formation and analyze their mechanisms, further understand the renal excretory function.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Contents：</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Operation</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Observation item</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">(1) The effect of normal saline</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">(2) The right vagus nerve was ligated and cutted. Stimulate the heart-end of the vagus nerve.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">(3) The effect of glucose</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">(4) The effect of diuretic agent on the volume of urine</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>14、</strong><strong>教学单元名称：人体血压、心脏和肺功能测定</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>授课时间</strong>：6-9节（6节理论讲解，7-9节实验操作配合研讨）</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>教学内容：</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1）间接测定动脉血压的原理；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">2）测定人体肱动脉的收缩压与舒张压的正常值；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">3）人体心电图的描记方法；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">4）辨认正常心电图的波形并了解其生理意义；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">5）心电图波形的基本测量分析方法；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">6）呼吸量测定方法及肺的一些正常生理指标。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>教学</strong><strong>目的：</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1）掌握间接测定动脉血压的原理；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">2）掌握测定人体肱动脉的收缩压与舒张压的正常值的方法；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">3）掌握初步学习人体心电图的描记方法；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">4）理解辨认正常心电图的波形并了解其生理意义；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">5）掌握心电图波形的基本测量分析方法；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">6）了解呼吸量测定方法；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">7）了解肺的一些正常生理指标。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Title of Lession 14. The human body experiments</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Class period：6-10</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Purpose and requests</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">The aims of this experiment are to comprehend the principles of measuring of the arterial blood pressure by using a sphygmomanometer with a cuff and master the methods. The systolic pressure, diastolic pressure and pulse pressure will be measured at the brachial artery.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Contents：</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Part I. Measurement of the Arterial Blood Pressure of the Human Body</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Subject preparation before measurement</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Method for winding cuff in blood pressure measurement</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Put the chest piece of the stethoscope on correct position</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Measure the systolic pressure</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Measure the diastolic pressure</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Calculate the pulse pressure (PP)</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Part II. Human ECG Recordings</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Operating procedures of the recording electrocardiogram</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Analysis of ECG</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Part III. &nbsp;Human pulmonary ventilation measurement</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Operating procedures</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Observation items</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>15、</strong><strong>教学单元名称：药物半数致死量（LD50）测定</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>授课时间</strong>：6-9节（6节理论讲解，7-9节实验操作配合研讨）</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>教学内容</strong>：</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1）药物半数致死量（LD50）的概念；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">2）小鼠给药方法；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">3）LD50测定及计算方法</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>教学</strong><strong>目的：</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1）掌握药物半数致死量（LD50）的概念；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">2）掌握LD50测定及计算方法。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Title of Lession 15. LD50 determination of Procaine </strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Class period：6-10</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Purpose and requests:</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Study and understand the method, procedure and calculation of LD50 determination.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Contents:</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1.Separate the mice to 5 groups. T</span></p>
<ol start="2">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Randomly, divide the mice into 5 groups of 10 mice each</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Inject intraperitoneally 1% procaine to the mice in each group with the dose of 110.8mg/kg, 147.7mg/kg, 196.9mg/kg, 262.5mg/kg and 350mg/kg respectively using 1.33 as the ratio between adjacent groups. Number the dead in each group within 30 min.</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Calculate LD50 by improved Carber’s method Results</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>16、</strong><strong>教学单元名称：</strong><strong>操作考核</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>授课时间</strong>：6-9节（分组操作考核，包括家兔操作和小鼠操作）</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>教学内容：</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1）实验基本操作和技能的要点和规范</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>教学</strong><strong>目的：</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">掌握实验基本操作和技能</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Title of Lession 16</strong>. Teaching Unit Title: Practical Assessment</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Class Time: Periods 6-9 (Group practical assessment, including rabbit procedures and mouse procedures)</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Teaching Content:</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1) Key points and standards for fundamental laboratory techniques and skills</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Teaching Objectives:</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Master fundamental laboratory techniques and skills</span></p></font></span><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
